

@token = {{$dotenv TICKTICK_ACCESS_TOKEN}}
@base_url ={{$dotenv TICKTICK_BASE_URL}}/habit
@habit_id = 6a5f37f66e0b607ac473b9c5


### Get habits
GET {{base_url}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get habit by habit id
GET {{base_url}}/{{habit_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create habit
POST {{base_url}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Read",
  "iconRes": "habit_reading",
  "color": "#4D8CF5",
  "type": "Boolean",
  "goal": 1.0,
  "step": 1.0,
  "unit": "Count",
  "repeatRule": "RRULE:FREQ=DAILY;INTERVAL=1",
  "recordEnable": false
}

### Update habit
POST {{base_url}}/{{habit_id}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Read more",
  "goal": 2.0,
  "repeatRule": "RRULE:FREQ=DAILY;INTERVAL=1"
}

### check habit
POST {{base_url}}/6a5f37f66e0b607ac473b9c5/checkin
Host: api.ticktick.com
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "stamp": 20260721,
  "value": 1.0,
  "goal": 1.0
}

### Get habit check-ins
GET {{base_url}}/checkins?habitIds={{habit_id}}&from=20260720&to=20260722
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### Habits real ###
@habit_real_id = 6a5f37f66e0b607ac473b9c5
### Create habit (Real)
POST {{base_url}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Drink Water",
  "iconRes": "habit_water",
  "color": "#4CAF50",
  "type": "Real",
  "goal": 8.0,
  "step": 1.0,
  "unit": "Cups",
  "repeatRule": "RRULE:FREQ=DAILY;INTERVAL=1",
  "recordEnable": true
}

### Update habit (Real)
POST {{base_url}}/{{habit_real_id}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Habito objetivo",
  "goal": 20.0,
  "step": 1.0,
  "unit": "Flex",
  "repeatRule": "RRULE:FREQ=DAILY;INTERVAL=1"
}

### check habit (Real, partial progress)
POST {{base_url}}/{{habit_real_id}}/checkin
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "stamp": 20260721,
  "value": 4.0,
  "goal": 20.0
}

### check habit (Real, goal reached)
POST {{base_url}}/{{habit_real_id}}/checkin
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "stamp": 20260721,
  "value": 20.0,
  "goal": 20.0
}

### Sumar +step al value actual de un habito real ###
# El checkin de TickTick no es incremental: cada POST fija el "value" total del dia (upsert por stamp).
# No hay endpoint para "sumar 1"; hay que leer el value de hoy y volver a mandarlo + step.

### 1. Leer el checkin de hoy del habito real
GET {{base_url}}/checkins?habitIds={{habit_real_id}}&from=20260721&to=20260722
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 2. Reenviar el checkin con value = value leido arriba + step (aqui step=1.0)
# Copia el "value" de la respuesta del paso 1 y suma el step antes de mandar esta peticion
@current_value = 5.0

POST {{base_url}}/{{habit_real_id}}/checkin
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "stamp": 20260722,
  "value": {{current_value}},
  "goal": 20.0
}
